      "description": "Top-level adaptive aero control shell containing transport packetization/depacketization, configuration register window, safety policy, fallback state machine, and bounded actuator output generation. The top module owns the external stream interfaces, the register interface, and the actuator outputs. It forwards compact outbound request packets to an external reference service and accepts compact inbound response packets for validation and safe command acceptance.",
